ne and artifact mechanics, teammate combinations, and random battlefield conditions. How to clear a level? How to build a team BD? Players decide for themselves. There is no standard answer, only better ones. We design mechanics that lead to unexpected outcomes created by the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/10a7bba1d5af39c344e08d30996b3e4a.poster.avif?t=1738597094\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/10a7bba1d5af39c344e08d30996b3e4a.webm?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/10a7bba1d5af39c344e08d30996b3e4a.mp4?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/f40c262643ce08ce480a11ead3747325.poster.avif?t=1738597094\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/f40c262643ce08ce480a11ead3747325.webm?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/f40c262643ce08ce480a11ead3747325.mp4?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System:</strong> In addition to rich combat and exploration, we\u2019ve added an important crafting system. &quot;Celestial Descends&quot; emphasizes the fun and randomness of crafting, recalling the joy of the &quot;Xuanyuan Sword&quot; when crafting magical items. We want players to experience the joy of creation and transformation. Players can collect various materials and recipes to craft powerful artifacts, potions, and charms, with each crafting attempt bringing unexpected results, making each try filled with surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/48b638f5962a12b6058e5a320232e8e3.poster.avif?t=1738597094\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/48b638f5962a12b6058e5a320232e8e3.webm?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/48b638f5962a12b6058e5a320232e8e3.mp4?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/7f35f37a1d0b8dc114a7b800f7fddbc8.poster.avif?t=1738597094\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/7f35f37a1d0b8dc114a7b800f7fddbc8.webm?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765320/extras/7f35f37a1d0b8dc114a7b800f7fddbc8.mp4?t=1738597094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World:</strong> As a tactical game, we decided to develop world exploration. After unlocking the world map in the main storyline, players can freely explore the large world, uncover side stories, mystical events in the Xuan Yuan world, and complete various challenges. Ride the Kun to explore and discover the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/